{"name":"RISE 차이나HSCEI(H)","issuer":"KB자산운용","index":"HSCEI (Hang Seng China Enterprise Index)","cur":"KRW","mkt":"KR","desc":"이 투자신탁은 홍콩항셍중국기업지수(HSCEI)지수를 추적대상지수로 하여 1좌당 순자산가치의 변동률을 추적대상지수의 변동률과 유사하도록 투자신탁재산을 운용하는 것을 목적으로 합니다.   <br>홍콩항셍중국기업지수는 Hang Seng Indexes가 발표하는 지수로, 홍콩증권거래소에 상장된 H-Share 중 규모가 크고 유동성이 풍부한 종목들로 구성되어 있습니다. <br>ETF의 설정단위는 100,000좌이며, 한국거래소를 통하여 매매하는 경우에는 1주 단위로 거래할 수 있습니다.","listed":"2016.08.10","fee":0.021,"aum":15920500000.0,"div_yield":3.63,"returns":{"1개월":-2.2,"3개월":9.35,"6개월":-1.86,"올해":-7.52,"1년":-11.39,"3년(연)":11.86},"sectors":[{"k":"FINANCIALS","w":28.14},{"k":"CONSUMER_DISCRETIONARY","w":20.96},{"k":"COMMUNICATION","w":17.34},{"k":"UNCLASSIFIED","w":9.83},{"k":"IT","w":9.08},{"k":"ENERGY","w":7.24},{"k":"HEALTHCARE","w":5.61},{"k":"MATERIALS","w":2.33},{"k":"REAL_ESTATE","w":2.12},{"k":"INDUSTRIALS","w":1.19},{"k":"CONSUMER_STAPLES","w":1.06}],"assets":[{"k":"EQUITY","w":95.07},{"k":"DERIVATIVES","w":5.13},{"k":"CASH","w":4.7}],"countries":[{"k":"CN","w":77.97},{"k":"HK","w":12.91},{"k":"MISC","w":8.34},{"k":"KR","w":4.7},{"k":"US","w":0.98}],"holdings":[{"code":"","name":"CHINA CONSTRUCTION BANK-H","w":null},{"code":"","name":"IND & COMM BK OF CHINA-H","w":null},{"code":"","name":"BANK OF CHINA LTD-H","w":null},{"code":"","name":"AGRICULTURAL BANK OF CHINA-H","w":null},{"code":"","name":"CHINA PETROLEUM & CHEMICAL-H","w":null},{"code":"","name":"PETROCHINA CO LTD-H","w":null},{"code":"","name":"XIAOMI CORP-CLASS B","w":null},{"code":"","name":"CNOOC LTD-H","w":null},{"code":"","name":"HORIZON ROBOTICS INC","w":null},{"code":"","name":"POSTAL SAVINGS BANK OF CHI-H","w":null}],"price":9365.0,"w52_lo":8640.0,"w52_hi":11825.0,"price_history":[["2025-10-03",11825.0],["2025-10-10",11315.0],["2025-10-17",11010.0],["2025-10-24",11290.0],["2025-10-31",11195.0],["2025-11-07",11165.0],["2025-11-14",11255.0],["2025-11-21",10895.0],["2025-11-28",11140.0],["2025-12-05",11160.0],["2025-12-12",11050.0],["2025-12-19",10725.0],["2025-12-26",10710.0],["